  "__behaviorActionCandidates_note": "P1-1B.1 (Refinement 2). These are NOT part of the formal behaviorActions enum. On the 50 pilot records the action vocabulary barely failed (fallback rate 1.1%: `other` 0×, `no_clear_action` 1×), so NONE of these candidates cleared the >=5-record admission bar. They are parked here as an extension list: promote a candidate to behaviorActions only when a future annotation pass produces >=5 real records that the existing enum cannot express losslessly. Keeping the formal enum compact is deliberate (奥卡姆剃刀).",

